                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi U
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} U
                  = succeed "." do
                    %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#CreationOfCoequalizersOfuSplitPairs"}
            %p
          %p
            The proof is reproduced for instance in (
            %a{:href => "#MacLane"}> MacLane, p. 147-150
            ,
            = succeed ")." do
              %a{:href => "#Riehl17"} Riehl 2017, 5/5/
          %p An equivalent, and sometimes easier, way to state these conditions is to say that
